{"id":614,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自律と協働で未来を切り拓く県立中高一貫教育","feature_description":"佐世保北中学校は、県立の中高一貫教育の環境で、基礎学力と自ら学ぶ姿勢を大切にしています。教科の学びに加え、探究活動や学校行事を通して、課題を見つけて考え、仲間と協働して解決へ向かう力を育てます。中学から高校までの見通しを持った学習と進路指導を行い、地域や社会に関心を持ち、主体的に行動できる生徒の育成を目指します。未来につながる学びを進めます。","clubs":[],"profile_sources":[{"id":3550,"attribute_key":"feature_summary","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/section/sasebokita-jh/","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-10","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null},{"id":3551,"attribute_key":"feature_description","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/section/sasebokita-jh/","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-10","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null}]}
